Thus assert: assert (fromIndex >= -1) => \forall int i; i > \result && i <= fromIndex; !this.get(i);

Need parentheses to ensure proper grouping: (fromIndex >= -1) => (\forall int i; i > \result && i <= fromIndex; !this.get(i));

Check syntax: The quantifier syntax is \forall int i; cond; spec. So we need: \forall int i; i > \result && i <= fromIndex; !this.get(i). That's fine.

